  "prefLabel": "Plc 601.03 Notifications; Issuance of Licenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 601.03 Notifications; Issuance of Licenses. The office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC) shall send all notifications to applicants and licensees and all licenses issued pursuant to this chapter in accordance with Plc 301.03.\n\nSource. #14631, eff 9-21-26, EXPIRES: 9-21-36",
